<title>MALAYSIA: Malaysia Nam Fatt 1996 net 42.75 mln rgt.</title>
<headline>Malaysia Nam Fatt 1996 net 42.75 mln rgt.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1997-03-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to Dec 31, 1996</p>
<p>		   (in million ringgit unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit		  42.75   vs	  43.30</p>
<p>    Shr	 (cents)	 52.1    vs	  54.4</p>
<p>    Turnover		   418.75   vs	 404.26</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit	    92.28   vs	  74.99</p>
<p>    Minorities	   less 26.48   vs  less   8.59</p>
<p>    Dividend  (cents)	 10.0    vs	  10.0</p>
<p>NOTE - Nam Fatt Corp Bhd is an infrastructure construction concern.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603-201 4813)</p>
</text>
